--
N5008 [temp.alias]/2, [temp.deduct.type]: deducing against a member
alias-template parameter whose underlying type has the same unqualified base
name (libstdc++ regex's _BracketMatcher) sent guess_template_args into
unbounded recursion (the qualified expansion was re-looked-up unqualified and
re-expanded the alias).  Alias expansion is now restricted to unqualified
template-ids so the deduction terminates and binds the arguments.
